    "url": "https://authentic8.com/blog/osint-chain-of-custody-digital-evidence/",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-06"
   },
   {
    "quote": "Transferring evidence without the methodology and context supporting it.",
    "url": "https://authentic8.com/blog/osint-chain-of-custody-digital-evidence/",
    "pass": 3,
    "first_seen": "2026-11-06"
   },
   {
    "quote": "However, the investigator fails to preserve the source URL, capture timestamp, collection method, or file integrity information.",
